  {
   "id": "blood-dungeon-404724@2026091805",
   "gameId": "blood-dungeon-404724",
   "displayName": "Patch 2026091805",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-22T21:41:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New Content!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spleunky 2’s “Ana” joins the Bunkhouse in the new underground Annex. Ana gets more luck the more of a map she explores. She also starts with a new Torch weapon that burns enemies on contact. There are a couple other Spelunky 2 themed upgrades to unlock-- a powerful yet dangerous Scepter weapon and an Eggplant charm which can give you a bonus heart if you complete its challenge. \\[editors note: had to temporarilty disable scepter while fixing a bug]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Two new spells have been added: Bling Ring has a chance at causing a new temporary blind status which makes enemies move in random directions rather than target you. Doom Ring add a chance at causing the new doom status. Doomed enemies die after a 10 second countdown. Bosses are immune.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There’s a new Coupon Book charm which makes all shop cages 30% off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The knockback system was reworked so that it’s more satisfying to push enemies back. There’s also a new unlockable Knockback bone shop powerup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Coin Finder charm has been turned into Coin Magnet which works like Blood Draw to suck in all money every 30 seconds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New associated quests for the new elements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Balance, etc",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Knockback system revamped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More Blood upgrades now multiply their effects rather than add.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some late game enemy health reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bones now cap at 66,666.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various weapon tweaks of all sorts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Flood’s oxygen bubbler interval was slightly shortened.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tips toggle now also hides locked-door bubbles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check out Spelunky 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
